<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board shall meet as often as may be necessary for the performance of its functions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Six members of the Board shall form the quorum at all meetings of the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The advisors to the Board shall have the right to attend meetings of the Board but shall not have a right to vote."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A question arising at any meeting of the Board shall be determined by not less than six votes of the members present and voting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board shall have power to determine the conduct of its proceedings."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board may invite any person to attend any meeting or deliberation of the Board for the purpose of obtaining views on any matter under discussion, but any person so attending shall have no right to vote at the meeting or deliberation."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
