<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_IV__cl_29> <https://schema.org/name> "The Minister may make such regulations as may be"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
