<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Financial Reporting Act 1996."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
