<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall come into force on such date as the Minister may, by notification in the Gazette appoint, and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into force of different provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_I> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/44/eng@> .
